      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valmeyer%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Illinois Route 156 runs along the new village’s southern edge and once passed through the old town center.",
